## Upstairs

::bg{location="player-house" time="morning"}
::music{action="start" mood="upbeat" volume="down"}
@narrator: Sunlight on the floorboards. The console in the corner is still switched on from last night.
@narrator: It is {{clock.weekdayLabel}} morning in Hollowtown.
::auto{character="mom" anchor="right" action="enter"}
@mom: {{userName}}! Professor Alder came by while you were asleep. He said to meet him at the lab.

<branch id="homeWake" prompt="Mom waits at the bottom of the stairs.">
  <choice id="go" label="On my way!">
    @mom{emotion="happy"}: That's my kid. Take a sandwich for the road.
  </choice>
  <choice id="late" label="Five more minutes...">
    @mom{emotion="worried"}: He said it was important, sleepyhead. Kai left an hour ago.
  </choice>
</branch>

@mom: Every kid in Hollowtown dreams of the day they get their first monster. Go on. Today's yours.
::auto{character="mom" action="exit"}
